OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'People think I'm drunk because of
OL,4,Amy rare illness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ability to breathe, regulate our
OL,7,Ftemperature and even digest our food
OL,8,Fwithout thinking about it is something
OL,9,Fmost of us take for granted.
OL,11,FBut for 69-year-old Eddie Robinson, who
OL,12,Fwas diagnosed with Pure Autonomic
OL,13,FFailure (PAF) five years ago, his
OL,14,Fbody's inability to control these
OL,15,Ftypically automatic processes means he
OL,16,Fdeals with a range of difficult
OL,17,Fsymptoms.
OL,19,FThese include feeling so dizzy he
OL,20,Fpasses out - sometimes leading people
OL,21,Fto think he is drunk - as well as being
OL,22,Funable to sweat or sleep undisturbed.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
