OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'People think I'm drunk because of
OL,4,Amy rare illness'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm one of 180 patients [with PAF]
OL,7,Fthat are known to the medical
OL,8,Fprofession [in the UK] - most GPs have
OL,9,Fnever heard of it because it is so
OL,10,Frare," he said.
